  "published": "2026-07-05T05:37:07.263Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "V1.0.0 release of Methrax.Bff.AspNetCore.\n\n    Features:\n    - Cookie-based authentication setup\n    - OpenID Connect (OIDC) integration\n    - BFF-style secure authentication flow\n    - Centralized configuration via appsettings.json\n    - Secure defaults for ASP.NET Core SPA authentication\n    - Minimal setup via AddBffAuthentication()\n\n    Security:\n    - No token exposure to frontend\n    - Cookie-based session authentication\n    - Secure cookie configuration support\n\n    Notes:\n    - Designed for ASP.NET Core + SPA architectures (Angular, React, etc.)\n    - Compatible with modern OpenID Connect providers (Keycloak, Auth0, Entra ID)",
